      "message": "On top of having the same issue as above, that means you can say `--apistubs` with no argument ? I guess it\u0027s not very harmful, but it\u0027s a bit surprising ; most programs would give you an error for that, and would only use \u0027*\u0027 when the option also makes sense without an argument. On the command line it\u0027s almost certainly a mistake (though I can see how this could be useful in a script considering the bizarre invocation syntax)",
